#: ../../index.md:1
msgid "nanocode"
msgstr "nanocode"

#: ../../index.md:3
msgid "A small terminal coding agent"
msgstr "一个小巧的终端 coding agent"

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid ""
"nanocode works in your terminal: you describe a task, and it reads code, edits files, runs "
"commands, and reports back. It keeps <span class=\"marker\">stable prompt prefixes</span> so "
"supported providers can reuse work, maintains a searchable code index, runs background jobs, "
"tracks its own working notes, and <span class=\"marker\">resumes where you left off</span>."
msgstr ""
"nanocode 在终端中工作：你描述任务，它读取代码、编辑文件、运行命令并汇报结果。它维护<span class=\"marker\">稳定的 prompt 前缀</span>，让支持缓存的 "
"provider 复用计算；同时维护可搜索的代码索引、运行后台任务、记录工作笔记，并能<span class=\"marker\">从上次中断处继续</span>。"

#: ../../index.md:10
msgid "nanocode editing code and running tools in one interactive session"
msgstr "nanocode 在一个交互式 session 中编辑代码并运行工具"

#: ../../index.md:15
msgid "Editing code and running tools in one interactive session."
msgstr "在一个交互式 session 中编辑代码并运行工具。"

#: ../../index.md:18
msgid "Use at your own risk"
msgstr "使用风险自负"

#: ../../index.md:20
msgid ""
"nanocode edits files and runs shell commands in the directory where you start it. It has **no "
"sandbox of its own**. Run it inside a container, VM, or another isolated environment when you "
"need isolation. See [Safety](safety.md)."
msgstr "nanocode 会在启动目录中编辑文件并执行 shell 命令，**自身不提供 sandbox**。需要隔离时，请在容器、虚拟机或其他隔离环境中运行。参见[安全](safety.md)。"

